{"seq":3,"slug":"bo-practical-engineering-constraints-and-multiobjective","title":"贝叶斯优化工程实操：约束优化、多目标帕累托与冷启动与可扩展性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/automl-hyperparameter-optimization-engineering/bayesian-optimization-surrogate/bo-practical-engineering-constraints-and-multiobjective","wordCount":3023,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"贝叶斯优化工程实操-约束优化-多目标帕累托与冷启动与可扩展性\">贝叶斯优化工程实操：约束优化、多目标帕累托与冷启动与可扩展性</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>教科书 BO 求解的是裸的 <code>min f(x)</code>，而工程里的 BO 永远带着三个现实包袱：<strong>约束</strong>（延迟、成本、内存在业务上不可越界）、<strong>多个目标</strong>（准确率与延迟天然互斥）、以及<strong>冷启动问题</strong>（零观测时 GP 退化为先验，BO 几乎等于随机搜索）。三者是三种不同的建模对象：约束变成可行性概率乘子，多目标变成帕累托前沿上的超体积指标，冷启动靠外部先验注入。此外 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的 GP 拟合与高维距离集中共同划定了可扩展性边界。本文按这四条线展开，每条给出 2026 年可落地的实现路径与取舍判据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"约束贝叶斯优化-把-不能碰-编码进采集函数\">约束贝叶斯优化：把「不能碰」编码进采集函数</h2><p>上一节把 BO 讲成一个无约束的 <code>min f(x)</code>，但真实的跨境推荐或广告出价调优里，目标旁边永远挂着几条硬线：单次训练 GPU 成本不能超过预算、线上推理 P99 延迟不能突破 SLO、模型尺寸不能撑爆端侧内存。这些是<strong>约束</strong>，不是可以加权塞进目标函数的软性偏好——把「延迟 ≤ 50ms」写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>latency</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f+\\lambda\\cdot\\max(0,\\text{latency}-50)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">latency</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 取小了约束形同虚设，取大了目标被压平、代理模型学到的是惩罚项而非真实响应面。</p>\n<p>约束 BO 的标准形式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">X</mi></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{x\\in\\mathcal{X}} f(x) \\quad\\text{s.t.}\\quad c_i(x)\\le 0,\\ i=1,\\dots,m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5217em;vertical-align:-0.7717em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1464em;\">X</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>概念上的第一性解法由 Gardner 等人 2014 年的 ICML 论文《Bayesian Optimization with Inequality Constraints》给出：<strong>为每个约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 单独建一个 GP 代理模型，把「可行」变成一个新维度上的概率</strong>。对未知点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个约束的可行性概率是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(c_i(x)\\le 0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，多个约束（在独立假设下）相乘得到联合可行性概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PoF</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∏</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PoF}(x)=\\prod_i P(c_i(x)\\le 0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PoF</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。约束期望改进（cEI）就是把普通 EI 乘上这个概率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{cEI}(x) = \\mathrm{EI}(x)\\cdot \\mathrm{PoF}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cEI</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">EI</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">PoF</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条公式的含义很直观：一个点即使目标改进潜力巨大，只要可行性概率接近零，它的采集值就被压到接近零。2026 年的工程实践中，<strong>你不会手写这个公式</strong>——BoTorch 的 <code>qLogExpectedImprovement</code> / <code>qLogNoisyExpectedImprovement</code> 都接受 <code>constraints</code> 参数，内部用 sigmoid 对指示函数做可微松弛（避免硬判断不可导），并沿用 LogEI 的数值稳定路径。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束处理方式</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>适用与陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>加权惩罚</td>\n<td>把约束折进目标</td>\n<td>简单；但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 无法先验标定，易压平响应面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cEI / PoF 乘子</td>\n<td>约束 GP × 可行性概率</td>\n<td>约束可观测、噪声低；需为每条约束多付一份 GP 拟合成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采集函数内积分</td>\n<td>对可行域做蒙特卡洛积分</td>\n<td>qNEI 约束模式；能处理「初始样本全不可行」</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个关键的工程事实：<strong>当初始采样点全部不可行时，无约束 EI 完全失效</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 未定义），而 qNEI 的噪声期望改进结合约束积分能自然地把搜索推向可行域边界。跨境电商的成本约束广告出价就是一例——冷启动期你往往没有任何一条满足成本上限的历史配置，这时必须先「找到可行点」再「优化目标」，两步走的采集函数不是可选项而是必需项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多目标贝叶斯优化-帕累托前沿与超体积\">多目标贝叶斯优化：帕累托前沿与超体积</h2><p>真实调优的第二天就会遇到第二个目标。模型调优里准确率和延迟天然互斥；广告出价里收入和成本互斥。这时不存在单一最优解，只有<strong>帕累托最优集</strong>。定义支配关系：点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 支配 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>（记 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≺</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\prec y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>）当且仅当对所有目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_j(x)\\le f_j(y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 且至少存在一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 严格小于。帕累托前沿是所有不被任何其他点支配的解的集合。</p>\n<p>多目标采集函数的核心是找一个<strong>可标量化的质量指标</strong>，把它当作单目标去最大化。主流指标是<strong>超体积（hypervolume, HV）</strong>：给定参考点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>（取各目标的最差点），前沿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 支配的超体积是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>⋃</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{HV}(A, r) = \\Lambda\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{a\\in A} [r, a]\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">HV</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⋃</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是勒贝格测度。HV 好在<strong>单调</strong>——前沿每改进一点，HV 严格增大——所以「最大化 HV 改进期望」等价于「让前沿整体向理想点推进」，并天然平衡了<strong>收敛</strong>（前沿越靠近理想点 HV 越大）与<strong>多样性</strong>（前沿铺得越开 HV 越大）这两个内在张力。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>采集函数</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>qEHVI</td>\n<td>Expected Hypervolume Improvement</td>\n<td>超体积</td>\n<td>确定性目标，目标数 2–3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>qNEHVI</td>\n<td>Noisy EHVI</td>\n<td>超体积</td>\n<td>高噪声（A/B 实验），目标数 2–3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>qParEGO</td>\n<td>ParEGO</td>\n<td>随机 Tchebycheff 加权和</td>\n<td>目标数较多（&gt;3），成本更低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>qNParEGO</td>\n<td>Noisy ParEGO</td>\n<td>加权和</td>\n<td>高噪声 + 多目标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>qEHVI 由 Daulton 等人 2020 年提出（arXiv:2006.02748），把超体积改进的期望做成可微、可批量评估的形式，用蒙特卡洛采样估计联合收益、用 autograd 求梯度。qNEHVI（Daulton 等 2021，arXiv:2105.08195）解决前者的噪声敏感问题——EHVI 假设每次观测精确，而跨境场景里目标（转化率）本身带随机性，qNEHVI 对已观测点的噪声做积分，避免在同一区域反复采样。<strong>目标数超过 3–4 个时 HV 的计算复杂度指数上升</strong>，此时改用随机加权和（qParEGO）更划算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冷启动-没有历史数据时先验从哪里来\">冷启动：没有历史数据时先验从哪里来</h2><p>BO 的整个价值建立在「用已有观测拟合代理模型」上，所以它的死穴恰恰是<strong>第一轮</strong>——零观测时 GP 退化为先验，采集函数只是先验方差的形状，几乎等于随机搜索。跨境电商的新业务线调优、新品类模型开搜，都会撞上这个冷启动问题。2026 年的成熟做法分三层，按成本递增：</p>\n<p><strong>第一层：默认配置 + 规则先验。</strong> 直接用成熟的默认超参（例如沿用同类任务的配置），或用粗网格/拟蒙特卡洛铺一批初始点。这是零成本基线，也是绝大多数团队的真实起点，同时是后续所有方法的对照组——如果元学习带来的增益打不过「用默认配置起步」，那套元学习就不值得上。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层：元学习与迁移。</strong> 核心思想是用<strong>一组已完成的历史任务</strong>给新任务提供先验。经典方法是 ABLR（Perrone 等 2018）与多任务 GP——把所有历史任务的观测联合建模，用任务间相似性迁移。更轻量的做法是<strong>热启动（warm start）</strong>：从相似任务的帕累托前沿或最优点注入若干初始观测，让 GP 一开始就有形状良好的后验。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层：先验拟合网络（PFN）当代理模型。</strong> 2023 年 Müller 等人的 PFNs4BO（arXiv:2306.05714）提出用<strong>先验拟合的 Transformer</strong>（TabPFN）替代 GP 做 BO 代理。TabPFN 在合成表格数据集上预训练，推理时把当前观测当作「上下文」一次性前向传播，直接输出预测分布——<strong>无需针对当前任务拟合任何超参</strong>。这对冷启动是结构性优势：GP 在 10 个观测上拟合出的核超参极不稳定，而 PFN 的先验来自预训练、在极小样本上仍给出合理的不确定性估计。TabPFN v2 于 2025 年发表在 Nature（Hollmann 等），在中小规模表格数据上报告了与调优过的梯度提升树相当甚至更优的表现；代价是推理成本随上下文长度增长。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>冷启动策略</th>\n<th>数据需求</th>\n<th>迁移来源</th>\n<th>主要成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>默认配置 + QMC</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>极低，作为基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Warm start 注入</td>\n<td>相似任务的解</td>\n<td>单任务</td>\n<td>需挑选相似任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ABLR / 多任务 GP</td>\n<td>多个完整历史任务</td>\n<td>任务族</td>\n<td>GP 拟合成本 × 任务数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PFNs4BO / TabPFN</td>\n<td>无（预训练权重）</td>\n<td>预训练语料</td>\n<td>推理成本随上下文增长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个务实的判断标准：<strong>只有当你能明确指出「相似任务」是什么、并能量化它们与新任务的相似度时，迁移才值得做</strong>。否则「相似」就是把噪声当信号注入先验，反而拖慢收敛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可扩展性-高维-大观测数与并行批量\">可扩展性：高维、大观测数与并行批量</h2><p>BO 有三个可扩展性天花板，破解路径各不相同，诊断顺序可固化为一张流程图：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;BO 迭代瓶颈诊断&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;观测数 n 大?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[&quot;稀疏 GP / 换 TPE&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{&quot;维度 d 高?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[&quot;ARD 砍维度 → TuRBO / SAASBO / REMBO&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F{&quot;能并行?&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[&quot;q-批量采集函数 + 多样性惩罚&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[&quot;先查 LogEI 数值稳健性&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"BO 迭代瓶颈诊断\"] --&gt; B{\"观测数 n 大?\"}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[\"稀疏 GP / 换 TPE\"]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{\"维度 d 高?\"}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[\"ARD 砍维度 → TuRBO / SAASBO / REMBO\"]\n    D --&gt;|否| F{\"能并行?\"}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[\"q-批量采集函数 + 多样性惩罚\"]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[\"先查 LogEI 数值稳健性\"]</pre><p><strong>观测数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 大。</strong> 标准 GP 每次拟合要对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\times n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 核矩阵求逆，复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、存储 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，实测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 超过约 1000–2000 后每轮迭代就会拖垮调优循环。对策是稀疏 GP / 诱导点近似，或换到 TPE（近线性时间、对高维类别空间更鲁棒）——这也是 Optuna <code>GPSampler</code> 官方建议在约 500 次试验以内使用的直接原因。</p>\n<p><strong>维度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 高。</strong> GP 在高维空间因「距离集中」失去区分度，所有点对看起来等距、长度尺度无法被识别。<strong>TuRBO</strong>（Eriksson 等，arXiv:1910.01739）把搜索限制在自适应收缩的<strong>信任域</strong>内用局部模型对抗维度灾难；<strong>SAASBO</strong>（arXiv:2103.14688）用稀疏轴对齐先验假设「只有少数维度重要」；<strong>REMBO</strong>（Wang 等）把高维问题随机嵌入低维线性子空间。工程经验：<strong>先做 ARD 敏感度分析砍掉无用维度，再谈算法</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>串行评估太慢。</strong> 集群能同时跑几十组配置时，一次只挑一个点等于浪费算力。批量 BO 让采集函数评估「一组点联合」的期望收益，用蒙特卡洛积分估计、用固定拟蒙特卡洛基样本保证曲面可复现，再对整批点做联合优化并施加批内多样性约束（本地惩罚 / 常量说谎者），避免整批点挤在同一区域。</p>\n<p>最后一道防线是<strong>数值稳健性</strong>，它常被误诊为「算法不行」。上一节详述的 LogEI（Ament 等，arXiv:2310.20708）指出：大量「EI 表现差」的结论其实是浮点下溢导致梯度无信息。<strong>在加约束、加维度、加观测之后，先检查采集函数是否还在正常工作，再质疑算法选择</strong>——这条排查顺序能省下大量无效的算法试错。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>约束要建模成约束，不是惩罚项</strong>：为每条 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i(x)\\le 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 建独立 GP，用可行性概率乘子（cEI，Gardner 等 2014）或采集函数内积分；BoTorch 的 <code>qLogNEI</code> 约束模式能处理「初始全不可行」的场景。</li>\n<li><strong>多目标用超体积指标</strong>：qEHVI（确定性）与 qNEHVI（噪声）直接最大化 HV 改进期望；目标数 &gt;3 改用 qParEGO。HV 的参考点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 要按业务「最差可接受值」设定。</li>\n<li><strong>冷启动分三层</strong>：默认配置打底 → warm start / 元学习迁移 → PFN（TabPFN / PFNs4BO）当代理模型。迁移只在能界定「相似任务」时才值得做。</li>\n<li><strong>可扩展性三面夹击</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 大换稀疏 GP 或 TPE，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 高先用 ARD 砍维度再上 TuRBO / SAASBO / REMBO，能并行就用 q-批量采集函数加多样性惩罚。</li>\n<li><strong>排查顺序</strong>：先验数值稳健性（LogEI），再质疑算法；先砍维度，再换算法。</li>\n<li>本文承接上一节的 GP 代理与采集函数基础（<a href=\"gaussian-process-surrogate-and-acquisition-functions\">高斯过程代理模型与采集函数</a>），搜索空间归一化与预算建模见 <a href=\"../hpo-search-strategy-theory/hyperparameter-space-and-search-budget-modeling\">搜索空间与预算建模</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>参考来源：Gardner 等《Bayesian Optimization with Inequality Constraints》(ICML 2014)；Daulton 等 qEHVI (arXiv:2006.02748)、qNEHVI (arXiv:2105.08195)；Ament 等《Log-Expected Improvement》(arXiv:2310.20708)；Eriksson 等 TuRBO (arXiv:1910.01739)、SAASBO (arXiv:2103.14688)；Perrone 等 ABLR (2018)；Müller 等 PFNs4BO (arXiv:2306.05714)；Hollmann 等 TabPFN v2 (Nature, 2025)；BoTorch 采集函数与约束优化文档 (botorch.org/docs)。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"贝叶斯优化工程实操：约束优化、多目标帕累托与冷启动与可扩展性","id":"贝叶斯优化工程实操-约束优化-多目标帕累托与冷启动与可扩展性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"约束贝叶斯优化：把「不能碰」编码进采集函数","id":"约束贝叶斯优化-把-不能碰-编码进采集函数"},{"level":2,"text":"多目标贝叶斯优化：帕累托前沿与超体积","id":"多目标贝叶斯优化-帕累托前沿与超体积"},{"level":2,"text":"冷启动：没有历史数据时先验从哪里来","id":"冷启动-没有历史数据时先验从哪里来"},{"level":2,"text":"可扩展性：高维、大观测数与并行批量","id":"可扩展性-高维-大观测数与并行批量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"树模型与密度估计代理：TPE、SMAC 及批量与异步贝叶斯优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/automl-hyperparameter-optimization-engineering/bayesian-optimization-surrogate/tree-based-surrogates-tpe-smac-and-batch-bo"},"next":{"title":"多保真评估模型：保真度定义、低保真偏差与调度权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/automl-hyperparameter-optimization-engineering/multifidelity-pruning-asha-hyperband/multifidelity-evaluation-and-fidelity-scheduling"}}